#========= DWBA input — single-proton pickup (d,3He)
# 16O(d,3He)15N to the 1/2- ground state via the 0p1/2 proton orbital.
#
# NOTE: this expands faithfully to a Cleopatra-style deck (PARAMETERSET alpha3,
# wavefunction phiffer with a v/r/a/param1/param2 projectile bound-state fit),
# but PtolemyCpp's transfer engine does not currently evaluate that A=3
# single-nucleon phiffer projectile fit, so this deck expands but does not run to
# a cross section. (d,p)/(p,d) single-nucleon transfer — which uses the av18
# projectile — does compute; see transfer_208Pb_dp.dwba. Included here to
# document the (d,3He) pickup syntax.
#reaction          gs-Jpi  orbital  Jpi(Ex)  Ex      ELab       Potentials
16O(d,3He)15N      0+      0p1/2    1/2-     0.000   12MeV/u    Ax
